{
  "source": "course-assets/whats-next/whats-next.mp4",
  "duration": 181.0346875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.92,
      "text": "Imagine you started a basketball team with friends."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.4,
      "end": 5.26,
      "text": "You spent months learning the fundamentals,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.76,
      "end": 8.8,
      "text": "running drills and practicing until everyone got better."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.28,
      "end": 12.42,
      "text": "But eventually someone stops and asks, what's next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.76,
      "end": 15.46,
      "text": "Are we joining a league or just practicing forever?"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.08,
      "end": 18.76,
      "text": "That is exactly where you are right now with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.2,
      "end": 20.68,
      "text": "You have learned the fundamentals."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.06,
      "end": 22.54,
      "text": "You know how these models work"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.54,
      "end": 24.52,
      "text": "and you have built important skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 26.18,
      "text": "Now you have to decide"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 28.18,
      "text": "what you are actually going to do with them."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.18,
      "end": 30.94,
      "text": "When thinking about how AI will change careers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.12,
      "end": 34.56,
      "text": "it is easy to worry that entire professions will disappear."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.98,
      "end": 36.48,
      "text": "But we have to look closer."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.16,
      "end": 38.94,
      "text": "A job is not a single action."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.26,
      "end": 41.46,
      "text": "It is a collection of distinct tasks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.46,
      "end": 44.78,
      "text": "and AI will not affect every task in the same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.24,
      "end": 46.96,
      "text": "The same logic applies to a teacher."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.56,
      "end": 49.64,
      "text": "AI excels at drafting lesson plans"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.64,
      "end": 51.28,
      "text": "or creating practice activities."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.72,
      "end": 54.36,
      "text": "But humans still own the core responsibilities,"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.68,
      "end": 57.72,
      "text": "knowing the individual student, building motivation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.72,
      "end": 62.96,
      "text": "adapting a lesson in the moment, and cultivating a classroom community. If you"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.96,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "are an electrician, AI can read complex manuals and suggest possible causes for"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 71.96,
      "text": "a failure. But you still have to work safely with live wires in the real"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.96,
      "end": 76.66,
      "text": "world, diagnose the actual physical environment, and adapt your tools on"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.66,
      "end": 81.44,
      "text": "site. For a graphic designer, AI generates quick drafts, color variations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.56,
      "end": 85.94,
      "text": "and possible visual directions in seconds. But a human designer must still"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.94,
      "end": 88.66,
      "text": "determine the project's purpose, understand the target"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.66,
      "end": 92.38,
      "text": "audience, apply artistic taste, and direct the final result."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.86,
      "end": 95.1,
      "text": "Because humans will remain responsible for the most"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.1,
      "end": 97.56,
      "text": "important work, you need to build capabilities"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.56,
      "end": 100.08,
      "text": "that you can carry into almost any career path."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.06,
      "end": 103.46,
      "text": "Here is a breakdown showing four practical moves"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.46,
      "end": 105.14,
      "text": "you can make starting right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.58,
      "end": 108.26,
      "text": "You do not need to choose your entire future today."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.82,
      "end": 111.64,
      "text": "These steps work whether you have a specific career in mind"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.64,
      "end": 113.56,
      "text": "or are still exploring your options."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.56,
      "end": 116.16,
      "text": "First, learn from people in the field."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.76,
      "end": 119.04,
      "text": "Talk to someone doing a job you're interested in."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.42,
      "end": 121.58,
      "text": "Ask them what a normal week actually looks like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.88,
      "end": 123.22,
      "text": "how their industry is changing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.22,
      "end": 125.92,
      "text": "and what students usually misunderstand about their work."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.64,
      "end": 128.36,
      "text": "Second, build real depth."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.88,
      "end": 130.8,
      "text": "Choose a subject worth learning seriously."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.36,
      "end": 132.9,
      "text": "Take the class, put in the reps,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.26,
      "end": 134.02,
      "text": "seek out feedback,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.34,
      "end": 136.56,
      "text": "and push yourself to learn enough about the topic"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.56,
      "end": 138.7,
      "text": "that you can spot the errors and nuances"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.7,
      "end": 139.94,
      "text": "that an AI might miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.68,
      "end": 142.28,
      "text": "Third, make something real."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.28,
      "end": 145.68,
      "text": "Use AI to build a project, organize a local event,"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.18,
      "end": 148.64,
      "text": "start a small business, or solve a specific problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.24,
      "end": 152.0,
      "text": "Keep the finished work as tangible proof of your abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.74,
      "end": 154.58,
      "text": "Fourth, step into responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.22,
      "end": 157.28,
      "text": "Join a club, volunteer in your community,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.28,
      "end": 158.5,
      "text": "or help lead a team."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.1,
      "end": 161.08,
      "text": "Put yourself in a position where you are responsible"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.08,
      "end": 163.56,
      "text": "for delivering a result that matters to other people."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.04,
      "end": 167.36,
      "text": "By understanding how these models work"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.36,
      "end": 169.9,
      "text": "and where human judgment remains critical,"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.9,
      "end": 172.66,
      "text": "you know how to be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.38,
      "end": 176.4,
      "text": "Keep learning. Keep building. Make your move."
    }
  ],
